    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ smeage man georne on æghwylce wísan, hu man fyrmæst mǽge rǽd aredian ðeode to ðearfe ⁊ rihtne Cristendòm swiðast arǽran ⁊ æghwylce unlage georne afyllen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And thought shall diligently be taken in every way how best to determine what is advisable for the public good, and how best to promote true Christianity and diligently suppress every injustice.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ smeage man symle on æghwylce wisan, hu man fyrmest mæge ræd aredian þeode to þearfe ⁊ rihtne Cristendom swyðost aræran ⁊ æghwylce unlage geornost afyllan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
